{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu15", "cards": [{"id": "u3.t.anaerobic", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">an<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ae<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">RO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">bic<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"anaerobic\" data-audio=\"audio/anaerobic.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: anaerobic\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"anaerobic\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Anaerobic<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">no oxygen needed<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Example<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bacteria deep in<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">mud or the gut<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Living or working without oxygen.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>厌氧的<\/b>：不需要氧气也能生存或工作。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">an- = without. Without air.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">an- = 没有。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does &quot;an-&quot; mean in anaerobic?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Without.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.bacteriophage", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">bac<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ri<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">phage<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"bacteriophage\" data-audio=\"audio/bacteriophage.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: bacteriophage\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u3-bacteriophage.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"399\" alt=\"Left: clear spots on a plate where phages killed the bacteria. Right: phages under an electron microscope (bar = 200 nanometres).\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Left: clear spots on a plate where phages killed the bacteria. Right: phages under an electron microscope (bar = 200 nanometres).<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">左：噬菌体杀死细菌后在平板上留下的透明斑。右：电子显微镜下的噬菌体（比例尺 = 200 纳米）。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Kornienko MA, Malakhova MV, Bespiatykh DA, Manuvera VA, Selezneva OV, Veselovsky VA … · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bacteriophage_vB_KpnP_Klyazma.png\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"bacteriophage\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M85 18 L115 18 L125 36 L115 54 L85 54 L75 36 Z\" class=\"f2 k\"/><path d=\"M92 30 Q100 24 108 32 Q100 44 92 38\" class=\"f4\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"86\" class=\"k\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"102\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"118\" y2=\"102\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"104\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"135\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">head (DNA)<\/text><line x1=\"133.0\" y1=\"28.0\" x2=\"120.0\" y2=\"34.0\"/><polygon points=\"120.0,34.0 123.2,30.1 125.0,34.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">tail<\/text><text x=\"125\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">tail fibres<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A virus that infects bacteria.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>噬菌体<\/b>：专门感染细菌的病毒。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">bacterio- = bacteria, -phage = eater. Bacteria eater.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">bacterio- = 细菌，-phage = 吞食。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does a bacteriophage infect?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Bacteria.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.plasmid", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">PLAS<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">mid<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"plasmid\" data-audio=\"audio/plasmid.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: plasmid\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"plasmid\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"70\" ry=\"30\" class=\"f6 d\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"65\" ry=\"26\" class=\"f3 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"92\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"21\" class=\"f1\"/><path d=\"M80 58 Q90 45 105 55 Q115 68 98 70 Q80 68 80 58\" class=\"f4\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"62\" r=\"6\" class=\"f5 k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">plasmid: small extra ring of DNA<\/text><line x1=\"130.0\" y1=\"100.0\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"70.0\"/><polygon points=\"130.0,70.0 132.2,74.5 127.8,74.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A small ring of extra DNA in a bacterium, often carrying genes such as antibiotic resistance.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>质粒<\/b>：细菌中一小环额外的 DNA，常带有抗生素耐药性等基因。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">plasmid = a little &quot;plasma&quot; ring.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">小环状 DNA。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Can plasmids move between bacteria?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes, for example during conjugation.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.vaccine", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">vac<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CINE<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"vaccine\" data-audio=\"audio/vaccine.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: vaccine\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"vaccine\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Harmless<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">piece of<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">germ<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Body<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">makes<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">memory<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cells<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Fast<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">defence<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">later<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A harmless piece or weakened form of a germ that trains the immune system to fight the real one.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>疫苗<\/b>：无害的病原体片段或减弱的病原体，用来训练免疫系统对抗真正的病原体。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">vacca = cow. The first vaccine used cowpox.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">vacca = 牛：第一支疫苗用的是牛痘。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does a vaccine give you the disease?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It contains only a harmless piece or weakened germ.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u3.t.viral-envelope", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">VI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ral<\/span> <span class=\"st\">EN<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ve<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lope<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"viral envelope\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: viral envelope\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"viral envelope\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" r=\"40\" class=\"f6 k\"/><path d=\"M100 40 L120 48 L120 72 L100 80 L80 72 L80 48 Z\" class=\"f2\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"10\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"136\" y2=\"26\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"26\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"60\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"60\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">envelope = membrane from the host<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An outer membrane some viruses take from the host cell, studded with spikes.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>病毒包膜<\/b>：部分病毒从宿主细胞获得的外层膜，上面有刺突。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">envelope = the wrapper around a letter.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">envelope = 信封：包在外面的一层。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Where does a viral envelope come from?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">From the host cell&#x27;s membrane.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.algal-bloom", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">AL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gal<\/span> <span class=\"st\">BLOOM<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"algal bloom\" data-audio=\"audio/algal-bloom.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: algal bloom\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-algal-bloom.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"640\" alt=\"An algal bloom in Lake Erie seen from a satellite. The milky green water is full of tiny algae.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">An algal bloom in Lake Erie seen from a satellite. The milky green water is full of tiny algae.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">卫星拍到的伊利湖藻华。乳绿色的湖水里满是微小的藻类。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Jesse Allen and Robert Simmon · Public domain · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Toxic_Algae_Bloom_in_Lake_Erie.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"algal bloom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.95\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Nutrients<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.15\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">enter the<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"73.35\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">water<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Algae<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">multiply<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fast<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Water<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">turns<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">green or<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">red<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A sudden, huge growth of algae in water.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>藻华<\/b>：水体中藻类突然大量繁殖。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">bloom = burst of growth, like flowers.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">bloom = 像开花一样突然繁盛。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What often starts an algal bloom?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Extra nutrients such as fertilizer in the water.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.chlorophyll", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CHLO<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">phyll<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"chlorophyll\" data-audio=\"audio/chlorophyll.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: chlorophyll\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"chlorophyll\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"30\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">green<\/text><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"85\" y2=\"50\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"85.0\" y1=\"50.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"50.0\"/><polygon points=\"110.0,50.0 105.5,52.2 105.5,47.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"115\" y=\"30\" width=\"70\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f6\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">light captured<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">chlorophyll absorbs red and blue light<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The green pigment that captures light energy for photosynthesis.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>叶绿素<\/b>：捕获光能用于光合作用的绿色色素。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">chloro = green, phyll = leaf. Green leaf stuff.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">chloro = 绿，phyll = 叶。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What colour is chlorophyll?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Green.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.contractile-vacuole", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">con<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TRAC<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tile<\/span> <span class=\"st\">VAC<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">u<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ole<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"contractile vacuole\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: contractile vacuole\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-contractile-vacuole.webp\" width=\"751\" height=\"738\" alt=\"A paramecium under a microscope. The two lines point to its star-shaped contractile vacuoles.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A paramecium under a microscope. The two lines point to its star-shaped contractile vacuoles.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的草履虫。两条线指着它星形的伸缩泡。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: derivative work: Hämbörger (talk) Paramecium.jpg: User:Josh Grosse · <a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 3.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Paramecium_contractile_vacuoles.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"contractile vacuole\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"62\" ry=\"24\" class=\"f1 k\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"33\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"29\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"28\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"28\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"29\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"33\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"87\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"72\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"91\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"92\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"92\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"91\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"87\" class=\"\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" r=\"8\" class=\"f1 k\"/><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"54.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"36.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,36.0 102.2,40.5 97.8,40.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"8.163265306122447\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">pumps water out so the cell does not burst<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organelle that pumps excess water out of freshwater protists.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>伸缩泡<\/b>：把淡水原生生物体内多余的水排出的细胞器。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">contract = squeeze. It squeezes water out.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">contract = 收缩。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Why do freshwater protists need contractile vacuoles?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Water keeps entering by osmosis, and the vacuole pumps it out.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.diatom", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">DI<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tom<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"diatom\" data-audio=\"audio/diatom.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: diatom\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-diatom.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"526\" alt=\"Diatoms under a microscope. Each one sits inside a glass-like shell.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Diatoms under a microscope. Each one sits inside a glass-like shell.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的硅藻。每一个都住在玻璃般的外壳里。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Prof. Gordon T. Taylor, Stony Brook University · Public domain · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Diatoms_through_the_microscope.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"diatom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"70\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"40\" ry=\"28\" class=\"f6 k\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"60\" class=\"\"/><ellipse cx=\"140\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"36\" class=\"f6 k\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"92\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">glass shell with two halves<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A single-celled alga with a glass-like shell made of silica.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>硅藻<\/b>：具有二氧化硅玻璃状外壳的单细胞藻类。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">dia = through, tom = cut: a shell in two halves.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">外壳分成两半。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What is a diatom&#x27;s shell made of?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Silica (glass-like).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.green-algae", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">GREEN<\/span> <span class=\"st\">AL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gae<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"green algae\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: green algae\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u4-green-algae.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"532\" alt=\"Spirogyra, a green alga, under a microscope. Its chloroplasts form green spiral ribbons in each cell.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Spirogyra, a green alga, under a microscope. Its chloroplasts form green spiral ribbons in each cell.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的水绵（一种绿藻）。每个细胞里的叶绿体排成绿色螺旋带。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Wiedehopf20 · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_freshwater_alga_Spirogyra.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"green algae\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"85\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"10\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"13\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">red algae<\/text><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"85\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"110\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"60\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">green algae<\/text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"110\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">land plants<\/text><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"47.5\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"47.5\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Algae with chlorophyll that are the closest relatives of land plants.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>绿藻<\/b>：含叶绿素的藻类，是陆地植物最近的亲戚。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">green algae share chlorophyll types with plants.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">绿藻与植物有相同类型的叶绿素。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which algae are the closest relatives of plants?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Green algae.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.mixotroph", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">MIX<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">troph<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"mixotroph\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: mixotroph\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mixotroph\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Makes food<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">photosynthesis in<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">light<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Eats food<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">engulfs prey when<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">needed<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organism that can both make its own food and eat other organisms.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>混合营养生物<\/b>：既能自己制造食物、又能摄食其他生物的生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">mixo = mixed, troph = feeding.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">mixo = 混合。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Why is euglena called a mixotroph?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">It can photosynthesize and eat.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u4.t.vector", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">VEC<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tor<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"vector\" data-audio=\"audio/vector.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: vector\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"vector\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"30\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"14\" class=\"f1\"/><path d=\"M55 60 L145 60\" class=\"s\"/><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"135.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"135.0,60.0 130.5,62.2 130.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><ellipse cx=\"170\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"14\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">host 1<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">mosquito = vector<\/text><text x=\"170\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">host 2<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organism that carries a pathogen from one host to another.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>媒介生物<\/b>：把病原体从一个宿主带到另一个宿主的生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">vector = Latin for carrier.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">vector 在拉丁语里是「搬运者」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name a vector of malaria.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">A mosquito.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u3.t.anaerobic", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Living or working without oxygen.”<\/i>", "opts": ["lysogenic cycle", "methanogen", "anaerobic", "microorganism"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>anaerobic<\/b>: Living or working without oxygen. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">厌氧的<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.bacteriophage", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A virus that infects bacteria.”<\/i>", "opts": ["pilus", "bacteriophage", "microbiome", "viral envelope"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>bacteriophage<\/b>: A virus that infects bacteria. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">噬菌体<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.plasmid", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A small ring of extra DNA in a bacterium, often carrying genes such as antibiotic resistance.”<\/i>", "opts": ["plasmid", "nucleoid", "extremophile", "decomposer"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>plasmid<\/b>: A small ring of extra DNA in a bacterium, often carrying genes such as antibiotic resistance. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">质粒<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.vaccine", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A harmless piece or weakened form of a germ that trains the immune system to fight the real one.”<\/i>", "opts": ["vaccine", "decomposer", "peptidoglycan", "nucleoid"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>vaccine<\/b>: A harmless piece or weakened form of a germ that trains the immune system to fight the real one. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">疫苗<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u3.t.viral-envelope", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An outer membrane some viruses take from the host cell, studded with spikes.”<\/i>", "opts": ["pathogen", "microbiome", "thermophile", "viral envelope"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>viral envelope<\/b>: An outer membrane some viruses take from the host cell, studded with spikes. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">病毒包膜<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.algal-bloom", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A sudden, huge growth of algae in water.”<\/i>", "opts": ["amoeba", "algal bloom", "flagellate", "phytoplankton"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>algal bloom<\/b>: A sudden, huge growth of algae in water. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">藻华<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.chlorophyll", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The green pigment that captures light energy for photosynthesis.”<\/i>", "opts": ["chlorophyll", "photosynthesis", "phagocytosis", "mitochondrion"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>chlorophyll<\/b>: The green pigment that captures light energy for photosynthesis. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">叶绿素<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.contractile-vacuole", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organelle that pumps excess water out of freshwater protists.”<\/i>", "opts": ["slime mold", "contractile vacuole", "phytoplankton", "diatom"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>contractile vacuole<\/b>: An organelle that pumps excess water out of freshwater protists. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">伸缩泡<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.diatom", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A single-celled alga with a glass-like shell made of silica.”<\/i>", "opts": ["diatom", "photosynthesis", "vector", "protist"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>diatom<\/b>: A single-celled alga with a glass-like shell made of silica. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">硅藻<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.green-algae", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Algae with chlorophyll that are the closest relatives of land plants.”<\/i>", "opts": ["green algae", "amoeba", "Plasmodium", "mixotroph"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>green algae<\/b>: Algae with chlorophyll that are the closest relatives of land plants. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">绿藻<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.mixotroph", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organism that can both make its own food and eat other organisms.”<\/i>", "opts": ["pseudopod", "algae", "mixotroph", "euglena"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>mixotroph<\/b>: An organism that can both make its own food and eat other organisms. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">混合营养生物<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u4.t.vector", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organism that carries a pathogen from one host to another.”<\/i>", "opts": ["paramecium", "kelp", "pseudopod", "vector"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>vector<\/b>: An organism that carries a pathogen from one host to another. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">媒介生物<\/span>", "whys": null}]}